      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3088979423046112
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "When the Police conducted raid in the house of the petitioner- Sanjay Kumar Nayak in Mathasahi, Tulasipur,\nCuttack along with him, other co-accused were present along with incriminating documents like fake IDs, fake appointment letters, fake attendance sheets and fake joining reports.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3124,
      "end": 3409,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Kumar Nayak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3187,
          "end": 3205
        },
        {
          "text": "Mathasahi",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3209,
          "end": 3218
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulasipur",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3220,
          "end": 3229
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuttack",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3231,
          "end": 3238
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24207718670368195
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The petitioner was arrested with the co-accused persons and forwarded in custody.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3410,
      "end": 3491,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2939724028110504
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that the petitioners are in custody since 02.09.2023/03.09.2023 and the trial has started in the meanwhile.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3493,
      "end": 3647,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "02.09.2023/03.09.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3582,
          "end": 3603
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11595551669597626
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "They further submit that although the allegation is that the informant has paid an amount of Rs.53 lakhs to the petitioner Sanjaya Kumar Nayak, but only Rs.10 lakhs has been paid through Bank and the said amount has also been returned by petitioner Sanjaya Kumar Nayak to the account of the brother Raj Ratna Mishra brother of the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3648,
      "end": 3989,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjaya Kumar Nayak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3771,
          "end": 3790
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanjaya Kumar Nayak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3897,
          "end": 3916
        },
        {
          "text": "Raj Ratna Mishra",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3947,
          "end": 3963
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13006173074245453
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Mr. Manas Ranjan Dhal, learned counsel for the petitioner Sanjaya Kumar Nayak submits that from the cross-examination of P.W.4, Rajkishore Mishra, the informant it would be apparent that the amount had been paid to the petitioner-Sanjaya Kumar Nayak towards purchase of products of Divyanshi Bengal cosmetic shop.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3990,
      "end": 4303,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manas Ranjan Dhal",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 3994,
          "end": 4011
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanjaya Kumar Nayak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4048,
          "end": 4067
        },
        {
          "text": "Rajkishore Mishra",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 4118,
          "end": 4135
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanjaya Kumar Nayak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4220,
          "end": 4239
        },
        {
          "text": "Divyanshi Bengal",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 4272,
          "end": 4288
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07364252954721451
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Both the counsel submit that as the offences are triable by a Magistrate and the petitioners are in custody since almost one and half years, they may be released on bail and that the petitioners shall abide with any condition which may be imposed for releasing them on bail and they shall remain personally present in Court on each date of trial and co-operate for expeditious completion of the trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4304,
      "end": 4705,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20505651831626892
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "They further submit that in view of the nature of allegations that the informant has paid money to the petitioners for arranging a job from them, the petitioners should be granted bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4706,
      "end": 4891,
